{"id":"n59933-1-13","stage":3,"title":"각종 · 各种","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59933-1-13-1","ko":"이게 뭐야? 맛있겠다.","zh":"这是什么啊？看起来好美味啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있겠다.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/eb664534b20ddd3ec09e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59933-1-13-2","ko":"새우, 오징어 등 각종 해물이 들어간 해물 볶음밥이야!","zh":"这是加入了虾、鱿鱼等各种海鲜的炒海鲜饭哦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새우,","meaning":"虾","explanation":"새우：虾","readings":[{"term":"새우","audio":"/audio/fd7862fa6687a6088a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63367","senseId":"1","lemma":"새우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오징어","meaning":"鱿鱼","explanation":"오징어：鱿鱼","readings":[{"term":"오징어","audio":"/audio/bb6eb188918c6c7346e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67456","senseId":"1","lemma":"오징어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"등","meaning":"等，等等","explanation":"등：等，等等","readings":[{"term":"등","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49992","senseId":"1","lemma":"등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"각종","meaning":"各种","explanation":"각종：各种","readings":[{"term":"각종","audio":"/audio/e549de3d3d5321412f93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59933","senseId":"1","lemma":"각종","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해물이","meaning":"海产品","explanation":"해물：海产品；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해물","audio":"/audio/f6cb48635568decd01fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85355","senseId":"1","lemma":"해물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어간","meaning":"包含，插入，夹进","explanation":"들어가다：包含，插入，夹进；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"5","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해물","meaning":"海产品","explanation":"해물：海产品","readings":[{"term":"해물","audio":"/audio/f6cb48635568decd01fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85355","senseId":"1","lemma":"해물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볶음밥이야!","meaning":"炒饭","explanation":"볶음밥：炒饭；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"볶음밥","audio":"/audio/f21a0587877f1d7f4cfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60202","senseId":"1","lemma":"볶음밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fd7862fa6687a608","term":"새우","zh":"虾","audio":"/audio/fd7862fa6687a6088a81.mp3","entryId":"63367","definition":"弯背长须多脚的水生小动物。","pronunciation":["새우"]},{"id":"bb6eb188918c6c73","term":"오징어","zh":"鱿鱼","audio":"/audio/bb6eb188918c6c7346e0.mp3","entryId":"67456","definition":"无骨柔软的长形身体上长有10条腿的，生活在大海的动物。","pronunciation":["오징어"]},{"id":"ad8c9dea07d94cab","term":"등","zh":"等，等等","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3","entryId":"49992","definition":"表示前面所说之外还有一些同类的东西。","pronunciation":["등ː"]},{"id":"e549de3d3d532141","term":"각종","zh":"各种","audio":"/audio/e549de3d3d5321412f93.mp3","entryId":"59933","definition":"多个种类。","pronunciation":["각쫑"]},{"id":"f6cb48635568decd","term":"해물","zh":"海产品","audio":"/audio/f6cb48635568decd01fc.mp3","entryId":"85355","definition":"来自海洋的所有动植物。","pronunciation":["해ː물"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"包含，插入，夹进","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"被插到某物内。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"f21a0587877f1d7f","term":"볶음밥","zh":"炒饭","audio":"/audio/f21a0587877f1d7f4cfe.mp3","entryId":"60202","definition":"把蔬菜或肉类等切细了放到饭里、用油炒成的食物。","pronunciation":["보끔밥"]}],"audio":"/audio/62f44c8dea15e30d18c2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59933","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这是加入了虾、鱿鱼等各种海鲜的炒海鲜饭哦！","这是什么啊？看起来好美味啊。","如果那个人不是真正的犯人怎么办？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是什么啊？看起来好美味啊。","如果那个人不是真正的犯人怎么办？","这是加入了虾、鱿鱼等各种海鲜的炒海鲜饭哦！"],"answer":2}]}
